{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/phi_thumbnail__1_.png?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHi is a 3D puzzle platformer that takes you on an emotional journey through 4 levels, each representing a key life experience. Solve puzzles, explore, and immerse yourself in stunning visuals and a powerful story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers over <strong>25</strong> creatively designed puzzles, each tested to evoke a unique emotion tied to the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/ks_explore_w.png?t=1745439465\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of a richly crafted world in this side-scrolling puzzle platformer. With four distinct levels, each evoking a unique emotion, each level offers new challenges and hidden content.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Lost! Find way on your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/explore.gif?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/ks_engage_w.png?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with the vast environments where every corner holds a new discovery, filled with Intractable Elements and NPC's, whether they\u2019re Key to Objectives, reveal Hidden paths or unlock Secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mystery and Path is yours to unfold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/engage_resized.gif?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/ks_solve_w.png?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve immersive challenges players to navigate complicated puzzles, events and hidden corners of the world. Every solution unlocks new paths, completes objectives, unravels mysteries and drives you deeper into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome the obstacles and Embrace the Mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/solve_resized.gif?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600240?t=1745439465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600240?t=1745439465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/dec4f8c2c3d6374e69b2345ce37541798a2d22ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745439465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/dec4f8c2c3d6374e69b2345ce37541798a2d22ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745439465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/phi_thumbnail__1_.png?t=1745439465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHi is a 3D puzzle platformer that takes you on an emotional journey through 4 levels, each representing a key life experience. Solve puzzles, explore, and immerse yourself in stunning visuals and a powerful story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gam